Nintendo. Medarot / Medabots and all related names and characters are trademarks of their respective owners.

This repository contains no game: no ROM, no Japanese script. Language packs store a translation next to a one-way
fingerprint of the line it replaces; binary patches store only the bytes the translation writes (copies point into
the player's own file). The tools read the files from the player's own legally obtained, decrypted dump and cannot
obtain the game.

English text: the English language pack is based on the fan translation by Omnija & Sotaeko
(https://github.com/Omnija/Medarot-9-3ds-Translations): their menu, battle and item texts are kept as they wrote
them, with serious errors corrected; the rest was translated from the Japanese for this project. Thanks to them, and
to roks70 (https://github.com/roks70/Medabots9-Translations), whose repository this project started from.

